cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use willow, please cite it as below."
title: willow
abstract: >-
  Ask questions of your own files, and get back only what you wrote or what
  you approved. One Python file, standard library only, with a hash-chained
  log and approvals made with a private key.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
authors:
  - name: The willow contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/willow-memory/Willow"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - local-first
  - personal knowledge
  - search
  - audit log
  - hash chain
